on or amend the marks criteria.","tables":[{"caption":"","rows":[{"criteria":"Intermediate marks (merit)","marks":70},{"criteria":"Widow","marks":5},{"criteria":"Orphan","marks":10},{"criteria":"Disabled (Divyang)","marks":5},{"criteria":"District Selection Committee Chairman's discretion","marks":10}]}]},{"heading":"How to Apply for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026","text":"Visit the official website: wdcw.tg.nic.in. Applications must be submitted online only, through this portal. Applications received through CDPO office, DWO office, public counters, post, or email will not be accepted or considered. Candidates must upload a photograph in the specified minimum size format as indicated on the online notification listing. Submit the completed application within the application window. The last date for submission of online applications is 15-08-2026, up to 5:00 PM.","tables":[{"caption":"","rows":[{"district_name_with_vacancies":"55 Anganwadi Teacher Posts in Rajanna Sircilla District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"178 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Bhadradri Kothagudem","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"115 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Mulugu District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"73 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Jogulamba Gadwal District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"343 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Nalgonda District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"242 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Adilabad District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"190 Anganwadi Teacher & Helper Posts in Kamareddy District","direct_link":"Click Here"},{"district_name_with_vacancies":"878 Anganwadi Helper / Ayah Posts in Bhadradri Kothagudem District","direct_link":"Click Here"}]}]},{"heading":"Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Important Links","text":"Apply Online: Click here Official Notification PDF : Click here Official Website: Click here Candidates interested in similar welfare-sector openings can also explore more Anganwadi Teacher Jobs and Anganwadi Worker Jobs across Telangana. Those looking for more opportunities within the district can check the latest Karimnagar Government Jobs across various departments. Candidates who have completed their Intermediate can also browse more Intermediate Qualification Government Jobs and Telangana WCD&SC Recruitment notifications matching their qualification.","tables":[]}],"faq":[{"question":"Q1. What is Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"It is a recruitment drive by the Department of WCD&SC, Karimnagar District, Government of Telangana, under Notification No. A1/1124/2026-27 dated 31-07-2026, to fill 60 Anganwadi Teacher posts across four ICDS projects in the district."},{"question":"Q2. How many vacancies are available in Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"There are 60 vacancies: 20 in ICDS Project Gangadhara, 16 in ICDS Project Huzurabad, 16 in ICDS Project Karimnagar Rural, and 8 in ICDS Project Karimnagar Urban."},{"question":"Q3. What is the last date to apply for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"The last date to submit the online application is 15-08-2026, up to 5:00 PM."},{"question":"Q4. What is the qualification required for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher posts?","answer":"Candidates must have passed Intermediate (12th class) or an equivalent qualification."},{"question":"Q5. What is the age limit for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"Candidates must be between 18 and 35 years of age as on 01-07-2026."},{"question":"Q6. Can any candidate from Karimnagar district apply for any Anganwadi Centre vacancy?","answer":"No. Each vacancy is restricted to candidates from the local area of that specific Anganwadi Centre - the Gram Panchayat for rural centres or the ward for urban centres. SC/ST-reserved posts are further restricted to SC/ST residents of that same local habitation."},{"question":"Q7. How can I apply online for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"Applications must be submitted online only through wdcw.tg.nic.in. Applications submitted through CDPO/DWO offices, in person, by post, or by email will not be accepted."},{"question":"What is Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"It is a recruitment drive by the Department of WCD&SC, Karimnagar District, Government of Telangana, under Notification No. A1/1124/2026-27 dated 31-07-2026, to fill 60 Anganwadi Teacher posts across four ICDS projects in the district."},{"question":"How many vacancies are available in Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"There are 60 vacancies: 20 in ICDS Project Gangadhara, 16 in ICDS Project Huzurabad, 16 in ICDS Project Karimnagar Rural, and 8 in ICDS Project Karimnagar Urban."},{"question":"What is the last date to apply for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"The last date to submit the online application is 15-08-2026, up to 5:00 PM."},{"question":"What is the qualification required for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher posts?","answer":"Candidates must have passed Intermediate (12th class) or an equivalent qualification."},{"question":"What is the age limit for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"Candidates must be between 18 and 35 years of age as on 01-07-2026."},{"question":"Can any candidate from Karimnagar district apply for any Anganwadi Centre vacancy?","answer":"No. Each vacancy is restricted to candidates from the local area of that specific Anganwadi Centre - the Gram Panchayat for rural centres or the ward for urban centres. SC/ST-reserved posts are further restricted to SC/ST residents of that same local habitation."},{"question":"How can I apply online for Karimnagar Anganwadi Teacher Recruitment 2026?","answer":"Applications must be submitted online only through wdcw.tg.nic.in. Applications submitted through CDPO/DWO offices, in person, by post, or by email will not be accepted."}],"_scraped_from":"https://www.freejobalert.com/articles/telangana-anganwadi-recruitment-2026-apply-online-for-60-anganwadi-teacher-posts-in-karimnagar-district-3061205","slug":"telangana-anganwadi-recruitment-2026-apply-online-for-60-anganwadi-teacher-pos","category":"12TH_Pass"}